  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II Preparing Media Practitioners</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Preparing Media Practitioners for a Resilient Media in Eastern Africa project aims to produce a better-qualified workforce in the Ugandan and Rwandan media who can contribute to democratization in their respective countries. The project will assist the opening of Rwanda&#x2019;s first local MA programme in Media and Communication Studies, and introduce Uganda&#x2019;s first PhD programme in the subject area. The project will engage in a three-tiered research project focusing on Media, democracy and develo</narrative>
  </description>
